---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import CourtReplay from '../components/CourtReplay';
import ScoutingLab from '../components/ScoutingLab';
import { href, articleUrl } from '../lib/paths';
---
<SiteLayout>
  <section class="intro-scene wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> SPORTS ANALYTICS & DATA PRODUCTS</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="hero-line"><span>See the game.</span></span><span class="hero-line"><span>Build what’s</span></span><span class="hero-line gold"><span>next.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="intro-description">I’m Bryan Kwan. I turn sports data into tools people can use—from a coach’s film room to a better roster decision.</p>
      <div class="intro-actions"><a href="#selected-work" class="button button-dark">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={href('about/')} class="quiet-link">Meet Bryan <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="intro-signature"><span class="signature-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Analytics. Engineering. A feel for the game.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-product"><div class="product-overline"><span>FEATURED BUILD / 01</span><a href={href('work/courtvision/')}>Inside CourtVision <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><CourtReplay client:load /></div>
  </section>
  <aside class="recognition-band"><div class="wrap recognition-grid"><div class="recognition-monogram" aria-hidden="true">UT</div><div><span class="eyebrow">UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO ATHLETICS</span><p>Real questions. A place to put the work to use.</p></div><a href={articleUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">Featured by Toledo Athletics <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></aside>
  <section class="section wrap" id="selected-work">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow gold">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2>Built around<br>a better decision.</h2></div><p>From the moment on film to the question in the data. A few projects that show how I work.</p></div>
    <article class="flagship-project" data-reveal>
      <div class="flagship-copy"><p class="eyebrow">COMPUTER VISION · FULL-STACK PRODUCT</p><h3>CourtVision<span>.</span></h3><p class="project-deck">The film. The floor.<br>The coaching conversation.</p><p>A connected basketball workspace for source-synchronized replay, shot maps, player context, and teaching moments.</p><a class="button button-dark" href={href('work/courtvision/')}>Explore CourtVision <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="project-maturity">Private coaching platform · actively developed</span></div>
      <div class="workspace-preview" aria-label="CourtVision capability overview">
        <div class="workspace-title"><span class="eyebrow">ONE CONNECTED WORKSPACE</span><span class="small-gold-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
        <div class="capability-grid">
          <div><span class="capability-number">01</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="5" width="40" height="27" rx="3"/><path d="M19 12L31 19L19 26ZM12 37H36"/></svg><h4>Film room</h4><p>Find the possession.<br>Keep the source in view.</p></div>
          <div><span class="capability-number">02</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 23L26 6L45 19L22 36ZM14 15L33 29M25 8L25 20L36 28"/><circle cx="24" cy="21" r="4"/></svg><h4>Spatial replay</h4><p>Inspect movement.<br>Follow the same moment.</p></div>
          <div><span class="capability-number">03</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="6"/><path d="M4 35V29A11 11 0 0 1 26 29V35M33 11H44M33 20H44M33 29H40"/></svg><h4>Player context</h4><p>Connect profiles,<br>practices, and seasons.</p></div>
          <div><span class="capability-number">04</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 8H29M9 17H25M9 26H19M5 3H34V16M5 3V36H34V31M22 30L26 22L39 9L45 15L32 28Z"/></svg><h4>Coach board</h4><p>Draw the idea.<br>Save a teaching moment.</p></div>
        </div><div class="workspace-bottom"><span>Python → React → 3D → Private cloud</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <div class="project-pair">
      <a class="work-card roster-card" href={href('work/basketball/')} data-reveal><div class="work-card-top"><span class="eyebrow">02 / BASKETBALL ANALYTICS</span><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="roster-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>SCOUT</span><i></i><span>COMPARE</span><i></i><span>CONSTRUCT</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 460 132"><path d="M20 102H440M20 65H440M20 28H440" stroke="#25425f" stroke-dasharray="3 6"/><path d="M30 96L100 73L175 78L245 39L325 50L430 15" fill="none" stroke="#ffd200" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M30 80L100 91L175 52L245 67L325 33L430 46" fill="none" stroke="#85bfff" stroke-width="2"/><g fill="#ffd200"><circle cx="100" cy="73" r="4"/><circle cx="245" cy="39" r="4"/><circle cx="430" cy="15" r="4"/></g></svg><span>Illustrative comparison</span></div><h3>The right player.<br>The right fit.</h3><p>Scouting, explainable evaluation, and roster constraints in one decision platform.</p><div class="work-card-footer"><span>Working dashboard</span><span>Read case study →</span></div></a>
      <a class="work-card business-card" href={href('work/astros/')} data-reveal><div class="work-card-top"><span class="eyebrow">03 / BUSINESS ANALYTICS</span><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="business-visual"><span class="eyebrow">OBSERVED REPEAT PURCHASE</span><strong>25.7<span>%</span></strong><div class="business-track" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div><span>462 repurchasers · 1,800 surveys</span></div><h3>What brings<br>a fan back?</h3><p>Turning fan-experience data into a focused operational experiment.</p><div class="work-card-footer"><span>Astros analyst case study</span><span>Read case study →</span></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="experiment-section" id="decision-lab"><div class="wrap experiment-grid"><div class="experiment-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow gold">02 / THINKING THROUGH THE INTERFACE</p><h2>Change the question.<br>Watch the answer move.</h2><p>A player’s value depends on the job the team needs done. Try changing the scouting priority, then look at the shot profile.</p><p class="experiment-aside">The inputs and scoring formula are visible. Good decision tools should invite questions.</p><a href={href('work/basketball/')} class="text-link">The basketball project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ScoutingLab client:visible /></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap" id="more-work"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow gold">03 / THE WIDER PLAYBOOK</p><h2>Different sports.<br>The same curiosity.</h2></div><a href={href('work/')} class="text-link">Browse all work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="workflow-feature" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">VOLLEYBALL PERFORMANCE</p><h3>From practice exports<br>to better questions.</h3><p>Session comparisons, player development, and setter–hitter chemistry in a browser-based workflow.</p><a href={href('work/volleyball/')} class="text-link">Explore the workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Bring in the sessions</strong><p>CSV and spreadsheet exports</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Make comparisons fair</strong><p>Volume-weighted, role-aware metrics</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Find the connection</strong><p>Setter–hitter chemistry and development</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="sport-links"><a href={href('work/#football')}><span>Football</span><span>Roster & operations ↗</span></a><a href={href('work/#soccer')}><span>Soccer</span><span>Scouting & role fit ↗</span></a><a href={href('work/#baseball')}><span>Baseball</span><span>Player data & coverage ↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="wrap closing-stories"><a class="research-story" href={href('research/')} data-reveal><p class="eyebrow gold">04 / BEYOND THE DASHBOARD</p><h2>Talent is global.<br>Opportunity is local.</h2><p>Exploratory research on development environments and elite athlete representation.</p><span class="text-link">Follow the research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><div class="personal-story" id="experience" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2>An analyst<br>who likes to build.</h2><p>I work across sports, business, and product development. I care about the whole process: finding the question, shaping the data, and making the answer useful.</p><a href={href('about/')} class="text-link">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
